<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75459" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρφν-η</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρφνᾱ</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the darkness</i> of
			night, <i>night,</i> first in <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1077
			</span></i>, and <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
			</span></i>, who has both <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὄρφνᾳ</span>
			and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ὄρφναισιν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>O.</u>
				1.71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>P.</u>
				1.23
			</span></i> ; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ὄρφνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					994
				</span></i>
			 (lyr., cj. <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ὀρφναίας</span>);
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθονὸς μέλαιναν ὄρφνην,</span> of
			the nether world, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				46
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέρων ἐς ὄρφναν</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				353
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε . . ἠοῦς, οὐκ
				ὄρφνης</span> neither at morn, nor <i>by night,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				14.2012
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Ca</u>
				4
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Rome</span>):—rare in Prose,
				<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Lac.</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				97c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				97d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				18.19.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phint.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.23.61a
			</span></i>.</div>
